		"description": "<p>At 1st level, a cultist can summon a spiraling vortex of shadows which appears in mid air within 30ft. It can be oriented in any direction, but takes up a 10ft cube. The dark vortex blocks line of sight through its area and is considered difficult terrain. A cultist may use this ability once per short rest, and it lasts for 1 minute.</p>",
